BookingStatus.description:
Where a booking stands. A hold pencils the date in; pending means the
buyer has accepted and the paperwork (contract, deposit) is under way;
confirmed is firm and may not clash.

FollowUpStep.description:
One follow-up after a pitch nobody has answered: so many days after the
last thing done, done this way. With a template it is a message to send;
without, a reminder (to ring them, say).
